            <note corresp="#d515-f4" n="36" xml:id="d515-f4-content">
                <p>In telegrams No. 1245, September 9, and No. 1247, September 10, Ambassador
                    Caffery recommended against such a proposal to the Brazilian Government on the
                    grounds of failure of the United States to fulfil its commitments as to
                    supplying planes to Brazil. (810.20 Defense/1468, 1472)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
